nue it |\n| 203 | finale RECAP blob: one artifact made of SEGMENTS in different seen codecs (unnumbered lines, space/`|`-separated chunks, or a codec named per segment), i.e. a Mastery set inside a single solve | gap (gap mixed-segment-recap-blob) | yes | several visibly different charsets in one blob (hex run, then `<~..~>`, then `U+`, then `1:c,`); line count ~= day count | split on charset changes/separators, decode each segment with `decode_chunk`, join verbatim, slug gate | med: last days of the event |\n\"\"\"+t[k:]\n# recognition cues\nrep(\" [0-9a-f] even, x2 ................ hex (D3); c1-e9/81-a9 + 40 -> EBCDIC cp037\\n\",\n    \" [0-9a-f] even, x2 ................ hex (D3); decodes to junk + ends `..e4` -> REVERSED hex (D28: fromhex(t[::-1])); c1-e9 -> EBCDIC\\n\")\nrep(\" lines 19/20 own BOM, 21/22 gzip/zlib, 23 `<~..~>`, 24 `1:c,`, 25 `U+XXXX`, 26 BF / 27 Ook from cell 0. NEVER pre-decode\",\n    \" lines 19/20 own BOM, 21/22 gzip/zlib, 23 `<~..~>`, 24 `1:c,`, 25 `U+XXXX`, 26 BF / 27 Ook, 28 rev-hex. NEVER pre-decode\")\nrep(\" STACKS (D16-17, D19-21): output hex/digits/b32/a-p/NUL-rhythm/compressed-magic bytes -> decode AGAIN.\",\n    \" STACKS (D16-17, D19-21, D28): output hex/digits/b32/a-p/NUL-rhythm/compressed-magic bytes -> decode AGAIN; a strict decode\\n   giving JUNK (D28 reversed hex) -> undo an outer rev/rot13/Atbash first; prompt quoting an OLD riddle = that day's codec is a layer.\")\n# gaps\nm=re.search(r\"(## Readiness gaps\\n\\n```json\\n)(.*?)(\\n```)\",t,re.S)\ng=json.loads(m.group(2))\npri={\"reversal-granularity-over-codec\":1,\"composition-matrix-depth2\":1,\"program-output-redecode\":1,\"mixed-segment-recap-blob\":1,\n     \"unseparated-token-bf\":2,\"brain-flak\":2,\"chicken-animal-esolangs\":2,\"spoon-prefix-code-bf\":2,\"boolfuck-bitlevel-bf\":2,\n     \"headsecks-wordfuck-bf\":3,\"print-statement-esolangs\":2,\"unlambda-rewrite-langs\":3}\nfor x in g:\n    if x['id'] in pri: x['priority']=pri[x['id']]\n    if x['id']==\"byte-fam